    "inscriptions": [
      {
        "inscription": "齊向中流渡，那知行路難。/\n前村青草長，煙雨□漫漫。/\n伯達",
        "inscription_translation": "Inscription at upper right:\n\nTogether, they wade through the middle of the stream,/ \nMindless of perils in the journey./ \nThe grass grows tall in the village ahead,/ \nWhile the mist and rain spread far and wide./ \nSigned “Boda”",
        "inscription_remark": "The “□” indicates a lost word.",
